  "raw": "{\"answer\":\"RoG 实验中，Freebase 的角色是 WebQSP 与 CWQ 的背景知识图：原文称 'Freebase (Bollacker et al., 2008) is the background knowledge graph for both datasets' [chunk_229cb41ae3582cc199c9ee25c4956269]。Wiki-Movies 的角色是 MetaQA-3hop 所基于的知识图：原文称 'We further select the MetaQA-3hop dataset (Zhang et al., 2018) which is based on Wiki-Movies KGs' [chunk_297df214042add51d3facf35d1934a3d]。按所给证据，未找到 RoG 使用 MetaQA 并报告跳数与指标的流程描述，因此该比较的方法证据不足；以上仅区分两个知识来源的角色。\",\"citations\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_229cb41ae3582cc199c9ee25c4956269\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_297df214042add51d3facf35d1934a3d\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"}],\"status\":\"partial\"}",
